      "name": "Packing Service Levels",
      "description": "Packing service levels from The Flat Rate Movers, quoted inside the one flat rate in writing before move day. Full packing: the whole home, every room, packed by the crew. Partial packing: the rooms or item classes the customer chooses. Fragile-only packing: just the fragile pieces. Unpacking and placement: boxes unpacked and items placed at destination so rooms come back together in order. The published audiences are residential, commercial, senior, and estate clients, served from Winchester, VA and Martinsburg, WV. Not published and not claimed: a standalone unpacking-only service; a pack-only service without a move; and a pack-for-storage scope. Those are industry patterns, not company offers, and they stay unpublished until the company publishes them.",
